          "settings": {
            "title": "<strong>Description<\/strong>",
            "content": "<p>Where Greatness Becomes Legacy<br\/><br\/>LEGXI Legacy in Motion | Edition 2026 is a tribute to the world's finest footballers, brought together in a single contemporary composition that celebrates the passion, unity, and enduring spirit of the beautiful game.<br\/><br\/>Every detail has been thoughtfully crafted to capture the movement, ambition, and emotion that define football's greatest stage. Interwoven paths symbolise the journeys of nations, while every figure represents the relentless pursuit of excellence and the legacies forged through the game.<br\/><br\/>More than a decorative artwork, Legacy in Motion is a museum grade collector's piece. Produced with exceptional craftsmanship and premium finishes, it is designed to preserve the spirit of an unforgettable football era for generations to come.<\/p>",
